  "slug": "skill-doctor",
  "name": "Skill Doctor",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Audits, diagnoses, and upgrades your Claude Code skills and agents",
  "longDescription": "Ships **3 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (3): `rollback` (Restore skills from the last skill-doctor backup), `skill-doctor` (Audit and improve your Claude Code skills and agents), `treat` (Apply skill-doctor diagnosis by building upgraded skills in a staging directory for testing)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install skill-doctor@claude-community` from `amaljithkuttamath/skill-doctor`.",
